lign="top">Post school education and training&#x02020;:</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;None</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">620 (27.9)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">615 (27.8)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Through work with formal qualifications</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">448 (20.2)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">424 (19.1)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Qualification other than degree from college or university</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">634 (28.5)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">627 (28.3)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Degree</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">502 (22.6)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">537 (24.2)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Not stated</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">19 (0.9)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">13 (0.6)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Employment status&#x02020;:</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Full time paid employment</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">1096 (49.3)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">1082 (48.8)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Part time paid employment</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">512 (23.0)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">508 (22.9)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;Student</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">207 (9.